---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { getView } from '../data/view.js';
const { items, L, catTitle, catImg, catAlt, catCount, l1, l2, c1, c2, c3, c4, c5, c6, navOpen } = getView(1, 1);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Donde Mario — Brasa y Marea</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bar y Restaurante Donde Mario. Mariscos y parrilla en Sardinal y Playa Hermosa, Guanacaste. Consulta la carta y encuentra tu sucursal." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Antonio:wght@400;600;700&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<div class="a-root">

<header class="nav">
<nav class="wrap nav-in" aria-label="Principal">
<a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Donde Mario, inicio">
<img src="/assets/5feb9e093da5fcacbec4291113d092da.png" alt="" width="44" height="44" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; display: block">
<span class="disp" style="font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: .04em">Donde Mario</span>
</a>
<div class="navlinks">
<a class="navlink" href="#menu">Menú</a>
<a class="navlink" href="#experiencia">Experiencia</a>
<a class="navlink" href="#ubicaciones">Ubicaciones</a>
<a class="navlink" href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
<a class="btn btn-fill btn-sm" href="https://wa.me/50689050330">Reservar</a>
</div>
<button class="burger btn btn-line btn-sm" type="button" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-expanded={`${navOpen}`} data-bind-aria-expanded="[navOpen]" data-action="openNav" style="width: 2.9rem; padding: 0; justify-content: center">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"></path></svg>
</button>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="mnav" hidden role="dialog" aria-label="Navegación">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem">
<img src="/assets/5feb9e093da5fcacbec4291113d092da.png" alt="Donde Mario" width="44" height="44" style="width: 44px; height: 44px">
<button class="btn btn-line btn-sm" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar menú" data-action="closeNav" style="width: 2.9rem; padding: 0; justify-content: center">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
</button>
</div>
<a class="big" href="#menu" data-action="closeNav">Menú</a>
<a class="big" href="#experiencia" data-action="closeNav">Experiencia</a>
<a class="big" href="#ubicaciones" data-action="closeNav">Ubicaciones</a>
<a class="big" href="#contacto" data-action="closeNav">Contacto</a>
<a class="btn btn-fill" href="https://wa.me/50689050330" style="margin-top: auto; justify-content: center">Escribir por WhatsApp</a>
</div>


<main>
<section class="hero" id="inicio" aria-labelledby="hero-t">
<img class="hero-img" src="/assets/f88afde2809d9b48eb2084ddc3d1a3fa.jpg" alt="Fachada de Restaurante Donde Mario, Seafood &amp; Steak House, iluminada al anochecer en Sardinal">
<div class="hero-shade"></div>
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div>
<h1 class="disp" id="hero-t">
<span class="line"><span>Sabor auténtico</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>de <span style="color: #E2B588">Guanacaste</span></span></span>
</h1>
<p class="fade" style="animation-delay: .35s; margin: 1.75rem 0 0; max-width: 34rem; font-size: clamp(1.05rem,1.4vw,1.25rem); line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(245,241,235,.86); font-weight: 300">Tradición costarricense, mariscos y parrilla en un ambiente que se disfruta. Sardinal y Playa Hermosa, Guanacaste.</p>
<div class="fade hero-ctas" style="animation-delay: .5s; display: flex; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap">
<a class="btn btn-fill" href="#menu">Ver menú
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
<a class="btn btn-line" href="#ubicaciones">Explorar ubicaciones</a>
</div>
</div>
<a class="scroll-cue fade micro" href="#experiencia" style="animation-delay: .8s" aria-label="Bajar a la experiencia">
<span style="writing-mode: vertical-rl">Desliza</span>
<span class="cue-track"></span>
</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="wrap intro" id="experiencia" aria-labelledby="intro-t">
<figure class="intro-photo reveal" style="margin: 0">
<img src="/assets/30a92be9d945b77a24f025213c81f9db.jpg" alt="Mario brinda con una copa de sangría frente al restaurante, bajo el letrero pintado de mariscos" loading="lazy">
<figcaption class="cap"><span>Mario</span><span>Sardinal, GTE</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="reveal">
<h2 class="disp" id="intro-t" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem,5.6vw,5.25rem)">Mar, brasa<br>y casa.</h2>
<p style="margin: 2rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.1rem,1.5vw,1.3rem); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 36rem; font-weight: 300">Donde Mario nació en Playa Hermosa y hoy tiene una segunda casa en Sardinal: Restaurante y Marisqueria Donde Mario, en Sardinal. Pescado, mariscos y cortes a la parrilla con porciones generosas y atención de casa.</p>
<p style="margin: 1.25rem 0 0; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 36rem; color: rgba(245,241,235,.68)">Abajo se come sin prisa; arriba, la terraza recibe cumpleaños, jubilaciones y mesas largas al atardecer.</p>
<blockquote class="quote">“Hace mucho no recibía un servicio tan espectacular.”<footer class="micro" style="font-family: 'Outfit',sans-serif; color: rgba(245,241,235,.6); margin-top: .9rem; letter-spacing: .16em">Reseña en Google</footer></blockquote>
<dl class="facts">
<div><dt class="micro">Horario</dt><dd>Sardinal 11:00 a. m. – 9:30 p. m.<br>Playa Hermosa 11:30 a. m. – 9:00 p. m.</dd></div>
<div><dt class="micro">En Google</dt><dd>4,5 de 5<br>98 reseñas</dd></div>
<div><dt class="micro">Teléfonos</dt><dd><a href="tel:+50689050330" style="color: #F5F1EB; text-decoration: none">8905 0330</a> · Sardinal<br><a href="tel:+50626720226" style="color: #F5F1EB; text-decoration: none">2672 0226</a> · Playa Hermosa</dd></div>
</dl>
</div>
</section>

<section class="menu" id="menu" aria-labelledby="menu-t">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="menu-head">
<h2 class="disp" id="menu-t" style="font-size: clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem)">La carta</h2>
<div class="locsw" role="group" aria-label="Elegir la carta de cada sucursal">
<button class="lsw" type="button" aria-pressed={`${l1}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[l1]" data-action="pickL1">Sardinal · Donde Mario</button>
<button class="lsw" type="button" aria-pressed={`${l2}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[l2]" data-action="pickL2">Playa Hermosa · La Casita del Marisco</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Categorías del menú">
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c1}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c1]" data-action="pick1">Entradas</button>
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c2}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c2]" data-action="pick2">Sopas, arroz y pasta</button>
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c3}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c3]" data-action="pick3">Mariscos y camarones</button>
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c4}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c4]" data-action="pick4">Pescados</button>
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c5}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c5]" data-action="pick5">Langosta</button>
<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed={`${c6}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[c6]" data-action="pick6">Carnes y pollo</button>
</div>
<div class="panel">
<figure class="feat" style="margin: 0"><img src={`${catImg}`} data-bind-src="[catImg]" alt={`${catAlt}`} data-bind-alt="[catAlt]" loading="lazy">
<figcaption class="feat-body"><span class="tag"><span data-text="L.brand">{L.brand}</span> · <span data-text="L.place">{L.place}</span></span><h3 class="disp" style="margin-top: .9rem"><span data-text="catTitle">{catTitle}</span></h3><p style="margin: .6rem 0 0; color: rgba(245,241,235,.72)"><span data-text="catCount">{catCount}</span> opciones en la carta</p></figcaption>
</figure>
<ul class="items items2 mfade" data-menu-items>
{items.map((it) => (<li class="item"><h4>{it.n}</h4><span class="price">{it.p}</span><p>{it.e}</p></li>))}
</ul>
</div>
<div class="menu-foot">
<p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(245,241,235,.62); font-size: .9rem; max-width: 40rem; line-height: 1.55"><span data-text="L.tax">{L.tax}</span> Carta de <span data-text="L.full">{L.full}</span>.</p>
<a class="btn btn-line" href={`${L.igHref}`} data-bind-href="[L.igHref]">Ver <span data-text="L.ig">{L.ig}</span> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="moment" aria-labelledby="moment-t">
<img src="/assets/400030e7dfade2c139c35146d23a1627.jpg" alt="Dos copas de sangría sobre una mesa frente al mar en Playa Hermosa" loading="lazy">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="disp reveal" id="moment-t">El sabor de la costa<br><span style="color: #E2B588">se siente diferente.</span></h2>
<p class="reveal" style="margin: 1.75rem 0 0; max-width: 30rem; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(245,241,235,.86); font-weight: 300">Sangría fría frente al mar en Playa Hermosa, brisa de Guanacaste y la cocina encendida desde el mediodía.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="gal wrap" aria-labelledby="gal-t">
<h2 class="disp reveal" id="gal-t" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem)">Quiero estar ahí</h2>
<div class="grid">
<figure class="g g1 reveal"><img src="/assets/0417de9f369187f99884a4a6e80f2ba1.jpg" alt="Platón de mariscos con langosta, mejillones y camarones" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Platón de mariscos</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="g g2 reveal"><img src="/assets/e6c93ae446208cdef185b670158d13a2.jpg" alt="Comensales al atardecer frente al mar en La Casita del Marisco" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Atardecer en Playa Hermosa</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="g g3 reveal"><img src="/assets/30a92be9d945b77a24f025213c81f9db.jpg" alt="Mario frente al restaurante con una sangría" loading="lazy" style="object-position: 50% 35%"><figcaption>Bienvenidos donde Mario</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="g g4 reveal"><img src="/assets/f8b7f883183dbade92c341ae3889aee4.jpg" alt="Langostas servidas con puré y vegetales" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Langosta</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="g g5 reveal"><img src="/assets/1304f3f2333fdd2340f856c0261c5cc8.jpg" alt="Pargo entero a la plancha con vegetales" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Pargo entero</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="g g6 reveal"><img src="/assets/29de63f50c2abb0dcc2e6b66443dc2e7.jpg" alt="Mojito de fresa sobre una mesa con vista a la playa" loading="lazy" style="object-position: 50% 60%"><figcaption>Frente al mar</figcaption></figure>
</div>
</section>

<section class="loc" id="ubicaciones" aria-labelledby="loc-t">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="disp reveal" id="loc-t" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem)">Dos casas,<br>un mismo sabor</h2>
<div class="loc-grid">
<ul class="loc-pick" role="group" aria-label="Elegir sucursal">
<li><button class="loc-btn" type="button" aria-pressed={`${l1}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[l1]" data-action="pickL1"><small>01</small><span>Sardinal<em class="lb">Donde Mario</em></span></button></li>
<li><button class="loc-btn" type="button" aria-pressed={`${l2}`} data-bind-aria-pressed="[l2]" data-action="pickL2"><small>02</small><span>Playa Hermosa<em class="lb">La Casita del Marisco</em></span></button></li>
</ul>
<article class="loc-card mfade">
<div class="loc-media"><img src={`${L.img}`} data-bind-src="[L.img]" alt={`${L.imgAlt}`} data-bind-alt="[L.imgAlt]" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="loc-info">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem"><img class="blogo" src={`${L.logo}`} data-bind-src="[L.logo]" alt={`Logo de ${L.brand}`} data-bind-alt="Logo de [L.brand]"><div><h3 class="disp" style="font-size: 2.3rem"><span data-text="L.place">{L.place}</span></h3><p class="micro" style="margin: .35rem 0 0; color: #E2B588"><span data-text="L.brand">{L.brand}</span></p></div></div>
<div><div class="lr"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><span><span data-text="L.addr">{L.addr}</span></span></div>
<div class="lr"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><span><span data-text="L.hours">{L.hours}</span></span></div>
<div class="lr"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg><span><a href={`${L.telHref}`} data-bind-href="[L.telHref]"><span data-text="L.tel">{L.tel}</span></a></span></div>
<div class="lr"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><path d="M17.5 6.5h.01"></path></svg><span><a href={`${L.igHref}`} data-bind-href="[L.igHref]"><span data-text="L.ig">{L.ig}</span></a></span></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: .6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: auto">
<a class="btn btn-fill" href={`${L.maps}`} data-bind-href="[L.maps]">Cómo llegar <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a>
<a class="btn btn-line" href={`${L.telHref}`} data-bind-href="[L.telHref]">Llamar</a>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="final" aria-labelledby="final-t">
<img src="/assets/815c0ce9db931a4e5df4a0be3a222ffc.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="disp reveal" id="final-t">Guanacaste<br><span style="color: #E2B588">sabe mejor aquí.</span></h2>
<div class="reveal hero-ctas" style="display: flex; gap: .75rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap">
<a class="btn btn-fill" href="#menu">Ver menú</a>
<a class="btn btn-line" href="#ubicaciones">Encontrar sucursal</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="foot" id="contacto">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="foot-grid">
<div>
<div class="brand" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem"><img src="/assets/5feb9e093da5fcacbec4291113d092da.png" alt="" width="56" height="56" style="width: 56px; height: 56px"><span class="disp" style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: .04em">Donde Mario</span></div>
<p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(245,241,235,.68); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 22rem">Bar y restaurante de mariscos y parrilla en Sardinal y Playa Hermosa, Guanacaste.</p>
</div>
<div><h3 class="micro">Navegar</h3><ul><li><a href="#menu">Menú</a></li><li><a href="#experiencia">Experiencia</a></li><li><a href="#ubicaciones">Ubicaciones</a></li><li><a href="#menu">Carta completa</a></li></ul></div>
<div><h3 class="micro">Contacto</h3><ul><li><a href="tel:+50689050330">Sardinal 8905 0330</a></li><li><a href="tel:+50626720226">Playa Hermosa 2672 0226</a></li><li><a href="https://wa.me/50689050330">WhatsApp</a></li><li><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Donde+Mario/@10.5060659,-85.6500054,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x8f9e2bb7d3ab4127:0x78598b9c78a79f5a!8m2!3d10.5060659!4d-85.6474305!16s%2Fg%2F11krfmssw2">Google Maps</a></li></ul></div>
<div><h3 class="micro">Síguenos</h3><ul><li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/p/Bar-y-Restaurante-Donde-Mario-100070538992558/">Facebook</a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/dondemariorestobar/">Instagram Donde Mario</a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/la_casitadel_marisco/">Instagram La Casita</a></li></ul></div>
</div>
<div class="legal"><span>© 2026 Bar y Restaurante Donde Mario</span><span>Sardinal · Playa Hermosa — Guanacaste, Costa Rica</span></div>
</div>
</footer>
</div>
<script>import '../scripts/restaurant.js';</script>
</body>
</html>
